Subject: [PATCH] Carpet TIS dispenser dragon breath and no item cost

Adapted for Mili from LophineLabs/Lophine 0134 and 0135 (7a51f49a512f1b5465f15a905d3704754e4bed02).
Retain the LGPL-3.0-or-later attribution to Fallen_Breath and Carpet TIS Addition
contributors (62c3cb6fff26cd9c4e12aa616b403c184a4a6ca0).
Refuse cloud targets outside loaded chunks owned by the calling region rather
than importing Scarpet's cross-region continuation engine.

